│ concurrent_invocation_mode parameter to the Agent class            │
│ constructor. This parameter controls whether the agent throws an   │
│ exception on concurrent invocations (current default behavior:     │
│ "throw") or allows concurrent invocations bypassing the locking    │
│ mechanism ("unsafe_reentrant").                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This patch involves:                                               │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Adding a new type alias ConcurrentInvocationMode in             │
│    src/strands/types/agent.py.                                     │
