│  3 Storing this parameter in an instance variable                  │
│    self._concurrent_invocation_mode.                               │
│  4 Modifying the concurrency locking logic in Agent.stream_async   │
│    to acquire the lock only if concurrent_invocation_mode ==       │
│    "throw". If mode is "unsafe_reentrant", skip the lock           │
│    acquisition and do not raise the ConcurrencyException.          │
│                                                                    │
│ The patch keeps all existing functionality when the mode is        │
│ "throw" and provides the requested unsafe concurrent invocation    │
│ option.                                                            │
