│    "unsafe_reentrant".                                             │
│  • Update Agent.init to accept the new parameter and save it.      │
│  • Update stream_async() in Agent to conditionally acquire the     │
│    lock and raise ConcurrencyException depending on the mode.      │
│  • Update the Agent docstring in init to reflect the new           │
│    parameter.                                                      │
